'''Saw Gerrera's Base'''<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|219|Galactic Britain II: Cassian's Travels}}</ref> was a [[Partisans|Partisan]] base located within the [[cave]]s of<ref name="Narkina 5" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="Narkina 5 AD">{{Andor|Narkina 5 (episode)}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> [[Segra Milo]]. In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Narkina Trivia">{{AndorDate|108}}</ref> rebel [[Luthen Rael]] met with Partisan leader [[Saw Gerrera]] inside the base to discuss a potential [[Spellhaus attack|mission]].<ref name="Narkina 5" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Saw Gerrera's Base was first pictured in the trailer for the ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' television series released on [[August 1]], [[2022]].<ref name="Trailer">{{SWYouTube|cKOegEuCcfw|Andor &#124; Official Trailer &#124; Disney+ (2:25)|sw_url=video/andor-official-trailer}}</ref> It first appeared in "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," the eighth episode of the series,<ref name="Narkina 5" /> which aired on [[October 26]], 2022.<ref name="Airdate">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1557442379975573504|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-08-10|quote=This is what revolution looks like. Watch #Andor, a Star Wars Original Series, streaming only on @DisneyPlus September 21.|archivedate=20220810191942}}</ref> The caves were photographed at the [[Wikipedia:Winspit|Winspit Quarry]], [[Wikipedia:Worth Matravers|Worth Matravers]] in [[Wikipedia:Dorset|Dorset]].<ref name="Guide">{{SW|url=andor-s1-e11-trivia-gallery|text="Daughter of Ferrix" Trivia Gallery &#124; Andor}} {{C|Slide 5}}</ref>

